@echo off\nREM Start NetOps Assistant with Docker Compose (Windows)\n\necho 🚀 Starting NetOps Assistant with Docker Compose...\necho ====================================================\necho.\necho Features:\necho   ✅ Ollama (llama3.1) bundled and ready\necho   ✅ FastMCP server running\necho   ✅ Network tools available (iptables, tc, ping, iperf3)\necho   ✅ Web UI on http://localhost:5000\necho.\n\nREM Check if image exists\ndocker image inspect netops-assistant:latest >nul 2>&1\nif %ERRORLEVEL% NEQ 0 (\n    echo 📦 Image not found. Building...\n    call build-docker.bat\n    if %ERRORLEVEL% NEQ 0 (\n        echo ❌ Build failed!\n        exit /b 1\n    )\n)\n\necho.\ndocker-compose up\n\necho.\necho 🛑 Container stopped\npause\n